    {
      "id": "mcp_tools_call_idempotency_key_argument",
      "description": "MCP tools/call whose registered tool contract has an idempotency_key argument. For an mcp dispatch the Issuer keeps params.arguments.idempotency_key in v1 and v5 bytes (the *_mcp_sha256 values); v6 keeps it anyway. Top-level request_id is stripped by all.",
